%h3 Hi Nitrous.IO Admin,

%p Please investigate why these boxes are dangling, help to fix/destroy the box and apologize to the owner, thanks!

%p Yours sincerely,
%p The Dangle Bot

- if @paid_boxes.present?

  %h4 Boxes of Paid Users

  %p
    %table{style: "font-size: 13px;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 16px;line-height: 150%;padding:20px;text-align: left;"}
      %tr
        %th ID
        %th Name
        %th State
        %th Region
        %th Owner's Email
        %th Created At (UTC)

      - @paid_boxes.each do |box|
        = render partial: 'dangling_box', locals: { box: box }

- if @free_boxes.present?

  %h4 Boxes of Free Users

  %p
    %table
      %tr
        %th ID
        %th Name
        %th State
        %th Region
        %th Owner's Email
        %th Created At (UTC)

      - (@free_boxes).each do |box|
        = render partial: 'dangling_box', locals: { box: box }
